# act image mappings — portable, no machine-specific flags here.
# Machine-specific flags (--container-daemon-socket, --container-architecture)
# live in the justfile's act-* recipes, NOT here — act reads exactly one
# literal .actrc with no merge/override mechanism, so putting a Colima- or
# Apple-Silicon-specific flag here would break every other machine. See the
# ACT_CONTAINER_ARCH / ACT_DAEMON_SOCKET justfile variables.
-P ubuntu-24.04=catthehacker/ubuntu:act-24.04
-P ubuntu-latest=catthehacker/ubuntu:act-24.04
--artifact-server-path .act-artifacts
